🔐 Secure Encrypted Chat Application

A real-time secure chat web application built using Flask and SocketIO.
This project demonstrates authentication, encrypted messaging concepts, chat history storage, and file sharing between users.

---

#  Features

* User Registration and Login
* Password Hashing for secure authentication
* Real-time chat communication
* Chat history stored in database
* File and image upload support
* Download chat history
* Animated login interface
* Clean and simple chat UI

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

Backend

* Python
* Flask
* Flask-SocketIO

Database

* SQLite

Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

---


# ⚙ Installation Guide

### 1 Clone the repository

```
git clone https://github.com/subitha06/secure-encrypted-chat.git
```

### 2 Navigate to the project folder

```
cd secure-encrypted-chat


### 3 Install dependencies


pip install flask flask-socketio


### 4 Run the application


python app.py


### 5 Open in browser


http://127.0.0.1:5000


 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint  | Description           |
| ------ | --------- | --------------------- |
| GET    | /login    | Login page            |
| POST   | /login    | Authenticate user     |
| GET    | /register | Registration page     |
| POST   | /register | Create new user       |
| GET    | /chat     | Open chat interface   |
| GET    | /logout   | Logout user           |
| GET    | /download | Download chat history |

